# Session start

At the start of every session, read and apply these guidelines to all code you write:

- **AGENTS.md** — project overview, key references, style summary
- **.github/copilot-instructions.md** — architecture, detailed guidelines, testing patterns, V2 migration, agent interaction style
- **.cursor/rules/coding-style.mdc** — immutable, declarative, recursion, map/reduce, function composition
- **.cursor/rules/pattern-matching.mdc** — ts-pattern with const pattern objects; no if checks
- **.cursor/rules/conventions.mdc** — path aliases, pitfalls, tree-sitter, v2
- **.cursor/rules/agent-behavior.mdc** — collaborative, validate, surface issues

Do not default to imperative loops or if/else chains. Follow the project's style from the start.
